gang's jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1204680,\"title\":\"Coyote vs. Acme\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kYDCl2y0VPvhT5eYWbMRInPoB03.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rueyXwlewVPAP5NkqCUJx4RjhqB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After Acme products fail him one too many times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner, Wile E. Coyote decides to hire a billboard lawyer to sue the Acme Corporation.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaet1xQ2nxrG0V1Ep9T20ZMNEIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1148365,\"title\":\"Matchbox the Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHhHRz6nOpwkqJs5ASeRGAdK2dt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdJsnhHfkIi3J7jwfiCFT4gXNx5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a group of former childhood friends reconnect, their reunion takes a wild turn as they stumble upon a dangerous international plot—and must save the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084242,\"title\":\"Zootopia 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oJ7g2CifqpStmoYQyaLQgEU32qO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lgotja3xMoJZbynwHfcQcJAEMWH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia's history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De'Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":153518,\"title\":\"The Angry Birds Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOH0fEFtV9z9rZp9zmBFGGeWicv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o4mhrLxv6I70kvYA42qANGUF7ya.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An island populated entirely by happy, flightless birds or almost entirely. In this paradise, Red, a bird with a temper problem, speedy Chuck, and the volatile Bomb have always been outsiders. But when the island is visited by mysterious green piggies, it’s up to these unlikely outcasts to figure out what the pigs are up to.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1327819,\"title\":\"Hoppers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u53UYu5XG2hNgWGvs3xGhAVzypl.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Scientists have discovered how to 'hop' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1185806,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxXSF4aY5N2cOGwaga5OnpPFHzk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dY4LyVSvjk9dN20YsxuouaMIMox.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Paw Patrol lands on a mysterious dinosaur island after a storm, where they meet Rex, a stranded pup. When Humdinger's reckless mining triggers a volcano, the team faces their biggest rescue mission yet to save the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":808,\"title\":\"Shrek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zscUsmzDJFZjUY8f8BQqMSWlmNQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Biv1mSzaaxWOqvcnDZn4GcYEAb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It ain't easy bein' green -- especially if you're a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"beNTTHnMIy8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"o8fzgkmyBOg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9NcwHkDtSko\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}